%% 客户端/服务端时序图 - 以结算(1030)完整链路为例
%% 依据实际实现：接入线程入队 → Worker 出队 → HandlerFactory → CheckoutHandler → 事务+原子扣减+促销链
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant CC as ClientController
    participant TC as TcpClient
    participant CH as clientHandler(接入线程)
    participant TQ as TaskQueue
    participant W as Worker线程
    participant HF as HandlerFactory
    participant H as CheckoutHandler
    participant SM as SessionManager
    participant PR as ProductRepository
    participant PF as PromotionFactory
    participant OR as OrderRepository
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>CC: 选择结算
    CC->>TC: sendRequest(1030, {user_id,token,items,promo_ids})
    TC->>CH: TCP 报文（16字节头 + JSON体）
    CH->>CH: NetUtil::recvFullPacket 解包
    CH->>TQ: push Task{code=1030, body}
    TQ-->>W: pop 唤醒（条件变量 notify_one）
    W->>HF: create(1030, ctx)
    HF-->>W: CheckoutHandler 实例
    W->>H: execute(req, resp)
    H->>SM: requireUser(token, user_id)
    SM-->>H: 鉴权通过
    H->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE TRANSACTION
    H->>H: lock_guard(stockMutex) 内存级互斥锁
    loop 遍历每个商品明细
        H->>PR: findById(product_id)
        PR-->>H: Product
        H->>PR: deductStock(id, qty)<br/>UPDATE stock=stock-qty WHERE stock>=qty
        PR-->>H: 成功 / 库存不足
        H->>H: 记录商品快照(name,price) 累加 totalAmount
    end
    H->>PF: PromoChainBuilder.build(promo_ids)
    PF-->>H: 促销链（策略+装饰）
    H->>H: VIP(level>=2) 包裹 ExtraDiscountDecorator(0.95)
    H->>H: chain.applyToItems(total, items) → finalAmount
    H->>OR: insert(order)<br/>order_no UNIQUE 冲突重试≤3次
    OR-->>H: 成功
    H->>DB: COMMIT
    H->>H: OrderEventBus.notifyOrderCreated 观察者广播
    H-->>W: resp={order_id,order_no,original,discount,final,promo_desc}
    W->>CH: send(2030, resp)
    CH-->>TC: TCP 响应报文
    TC-->>CC: receiveResponse → code=2030
    CC-->>U: 渲染结算结果
    Note over H,DB: 任一步失败 → ROLLBACK → 返回 4001（业务错误码）
